R1 swap p, q  (user copy ctor and let)
  ctor #1 (1)
  ctor #2 (2)
  after: p=#2 t2  q=#1 t1
  dtor #1
  dtor #2
R1: ctor=2 copy=0 let=0 dtor=2 balance=ok

R2 swap of two UDTs holding dynamic arrays
  ctor #3
  ctor #4
  after: p ubound=3 q ubound=2
  dtor #3
  dtor #4
R2: ctor=2 copy=0 let=0 dtor=2 balance=ok

R3 redim preserve 2 -> 8 elements
  ctor #5
  ctor #6
  -- preserve
  ctor #7
  ctor #8
  ctor #9
  ctor #10
  ctor #11
  ctor #12
  a(0) is the same object, t5
  dtor #12
  dtor #11
  dtor #10
  dtor #9
  dtor #8
  dtor #7
  dtor #6
  dtor #5
R3: ctor=8 copy=0 let=0 dtor=8 balance=ok

